        <p>NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN, that a GENERAL SESSION of the Peace for the County Palatine of Lancaster will be holden at the County Sessi...ns House, Islington, in Liverpool, on TUESDAY, the 6th day of JUNE next, at eleven o'clock in the forenoon precisely. The Solicitors engaged in prosecutions at the said Session are requested to take notice that all instructions for indictments and depositions are required to be sent to the Clerk of the Peace's Office seven days at least before the said Session. F. C. HULTON, Clerk of the Peace. Clerk of the Peace's Office, Preston, 20th May, 1893.</p>
